    "background_story": "Marley was a bright-eyed and curious six-year-old who saw the world with unbridled wonder. Her innocence was a refreshing balm to those around her, reminding them of the simple joys in life. She would spend hours exploring the woods behind her house, collecting leaves and watching butterflies dance in the sunlight. Marley's laughter was contagious, and her smile could light up a room. She had a special gift for befriending the most unlikely of creatures, from the grumpiest of cats to the shyest of classmates. As she navigated the complexities of growing up, Marley's innocence remained intact, a reminder to those around her to cherish the beauty and magic of childhood.",
